icked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements.","type":"text"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTextArea":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstextarea","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTextArea"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"OUDSTextArea","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextArea","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTextArea"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Text area is a UI element that allows to type, edit, or select longer blocks of textual data, such as comments, messages or descriptions;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by expanding vertically and offering more space to input text.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It provides a visual and interactive affordance for multiline text entry while supporting labels, placeholders, descriptions, and validation feedback.","type":"text"}]},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":null}}}